  "historyNote": "#2044, eff 6-3-82; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86, EXPIRED: 1-28-92; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92 New. #5846, eff 6-22-94, EXPIRED: 6-22-00 New. #9580, eff 10-24-09; ss by #12407, INTERIM, eff 10-24-17, EXPIRED: 4-22-18 New. #13166, eff 1-28-21; ss by #14081, eff 9-25-24, EXPIRES: 9-25-34 (formerly He-P 802.13)",
